      <sparkle:version>29</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.27</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>11.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>New inline approval card in the chat panel: one approval at a time with queued follow-ups, keeping the agent unblocked.</li><li>Codex provider onboarding: guided install + ChatGPT sign-in when the CLI is missing or signed out (API-key mode disallowed).</li><li>Voice + wake-phrase reliability improvements.</li></ul>]]></description>
